<title>THAILAND: Thai grains discharge schedule for Jan 30.</title>
<headline>Thai grains discharge schedule for Jan 30.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Independent surveyors detailed</p>
<p>grains discharges at Thai ports as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>Vessel	   Date of Arrival     Commodity	    Amount</p>
<p>Feng Xiang	   Jan 8	   Indian soymeal	 11,287</p>
<p>Stefan Naradia     Jan 8	   Indian soymeal	  5,489</p>
<p>					   groundnut meal	  1,049</p>
<p>Or Han Ekanci	Jan 8	   US soybean	     34,539</p>
<p>Luck Nam	     Jan 9	   Indian groundnut meal 7,000</p>
<p>					   soymeal		   5,000</p>
<p>Karavo Naragos     Jan 14	  Indian soymeal	 10,900</p>
<p>Hai Lee		Jan 18	  Indian soymeal	 12,000</p>
<p>Master Panos	 Jan 22	  ARG sunflower meal    4,200</p>
<p>					   ARG soymeal	     4,000</p>
<p>Dali		   Feb 2	   Indian soymeal	  8,200</p>
<p>					   groundnut meal	  3,488</p>
<p>Hallard		Feb 15	  Indian soymeal	 12,000</p>
<p>Song Shan	     N/A	    Indian soymeal	  5,700</p>
<p>					   rapeseed meal	   2,000</p>
<p>					   groundnut meal	  3,000</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
